---
import { ChartColumn, Mail, Megaphone, Shield, Sparkles, Workflow } from '@mailflow/ui/icons'
---

<section id="features" class="px-4 py-24 md:px-6">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-4xl">
        Everything you need to grow
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        One complete platform that eliminates the need to jump between ten different tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article
        class="group rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/60 p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/30 hover:bg-card"
      >
        <div
          class="mb-4 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/15"
        >
          <Mail aria-hidden="true" className="size-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-card-foreground">Unified inbox</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Bring all your emails together in one place. Smart filters, quick replies, and automatic
          labels keep you in control.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article
        class="group rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/60 p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/30 hover:bg-card"
      >
        <div
          class="mb-4 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/15"
        >
          <Megaphone aria-hidden="true" className="size-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-card-foreground">Campaigns that convert</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Create, personalize, and send campaigns in minutes. Advanced segmentation, professional
          templates, and real-time metrics.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article
        class="group rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/60 p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/30 hover:bg-card"
      >
        <div
          class="mb-4 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/15"
        >
          <Workflow aria-hidden="true" className="size-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-card-foreground">Visual automations</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Build customer journeys on an intuitive canvas. Connect triggers, conditions, and actions
          without writing code.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article
        class="group rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/60 p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/30 hover:bg-card"
      >
        <div
          class="mb-4 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/15"
        >
          <Sparkles aria-hidden="true" className="size-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-card-foreground">Built-in AI assistant</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Write emails, summarize conversations, generate campaign ideas, and get recommendations
          based on your account data.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article
        class="group rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/60 p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/30 hover:bg-card"
      >
        <div
          class="mb-4 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/15"
        >
          <ChartColumn aria-hidden="true" className="size-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-card-foreground">Real-time analytics</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Track opens, clicks, conversions, and revenue. Clean, exportable dashboards make results
          easy to share.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article
        class="group rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/60 p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/30 hover:bg-card"
      >
        <div
          class="mb-4 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/15"
        >
          <Shield aria-hidden="true" className="size-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-card-foreground">Security and compliance</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Authentication, granular permissions, and encryption keep your data protected and
          compliant with LGPD and GDPR.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
